h1 New #{@feedback.feedback_type.titleize} Submission

p A new #{@feedback.feedback_type} has been submitted through the website:

.space-y-4
  .bg-gray-50.p-4.rounded-lg
    h3.text-lg.font-semibold.mb-2 Submission Details
    p
      strong Name: 
      = @feedback.name
    p
      strong Email: 
      = @feedback.email
    p
      strong Type: 
      = @feedback.feedback_type.titleize
    p
      strong Submitted: 
      = @feedback.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p")

  .bg-white.p-4.border.rounded-lg
    h3.text-lg.font-semibold.mb-2 Content
    .prose.max-w-none
      = simple_format(@feedback.content)

  - if @feedback.image.attached?
    .bg-white.p-4.border.rounded-lg
      h3.text-lg.font-semibold.mb-2 Attached Image
      p.text-sm.text-gray-600.mb-2 = @feedback.image.filename
      p.text-sm.text-gray-500
        | Image size: #{number_to_human_size(@feedback.image.byte_size)}

p.text-sm.text-gray-600.mt-6
  | This feedback was submitted through the Baldrick Boards website feedback form.
  br
  | Please review and consider featuring it on the appropriate page.
